<title>USA: PHLX to trade Genzyme Transgenics options.</title>
<headline>PHLX to trade Genzyme Transgenics options.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philadelphia Stock Exchange (PHLX) said Monday it would begin trading options on shares of Genzyme Transgenics Corp on March 13.</p>
<p>The options would open with strike prices of 7-1/2, 10 and 12-1/2, with position limits of 4,500 contracts, the PHLX said. The stock was unchanged at 8-7/8 Monday afternoon.</p>
<p>Initial expirations have been set for April, May, June and September, the PHLX said. It said Group One Ltd has been named the specialist unit.</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>((E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com))</p>
